<title>SOUTH KOREA: Former South Korean defence minister jailed.</title>
<headline>Former South Korean defence minister jailed.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former South Korean defence minister Lee Yang-ho was sentenced to four years in jail on Tuesday on charges of bribery and leaking military secrets, a court official said.</p>
</text>
